g\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563310/extras/9f1ef603c9e5c28bad8e3e3ce52a470c.avif?t=1682529951\" /></div><br><br>The grading scale used by the game is, from most accurate press to least, OK, Perfect and Miss. Consecutive OK and Perfect notes add both to the player's combo meter. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1563310/extras/f74f95904ac5d42d410a8c0fcbd6300b.avif?t=1682529951\" /></div>",
